{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"c8a648f0-ea5f-44cc-a06b-ac05ce44e8d8","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented the analytics events as specified in **docs/EVENTS.md**.\n\nKey updates:\n\n- **Registration screen** (`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`):\n  - Imported the `Analytics` wrapper.\n  - Added flag variables to ensure each event fires only once per screen visit.\n  - Updated email and phone fields to capture `registration_email_started` and `registration_phone_started` on first edit.\n  - Modified the loan amount slider to capture `loan_amount_changed` on `onChangeEnd`, sending the amount as an integer property.\n  - Updated the terms checkbox to capture `terms_accepted` when first checked.\n  - Updated the Continue button to capture `registration_continue_tapped` with `amount` and `terms` properties.\n\n- **Offers screen** (`lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`):\n  - Imported the `Analytics` wrapper.\n  - Wrapped the offer list in a `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` to capture `offers_scrolled` with the scroll offset.\n\nDetails of the changes and rationale are documented in the generated **ANSWER.md** artifact. You can review it here:\n\n[ANSWER.md](/Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/c8a648f0-ea5f-44cc-a06b-ac05ce44e8d8/ANSWER.md)\n","duration_seconds":246.399703,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":49794,"output_tokens":28803,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":1121344,"total_tokens":78597}}}
